TAP user_question.3 0 0 pos:start 1  # '^ you $': needs pos:start at 0..0
TAP user_question.3 0 0 w:you 1  # '^ you $': needs w:you at 0..0
BIAS D user_question.3 -2  # AND of the 3 required parts of '^ you $'
LINK U user_question D:user_question.3 1  # '^ you $' is one way of saying: the user turns the question back
VOCAB ?  # a word a detector reads: known, so never read as a typo of another word
