UNIT U fo_ask_recall_user_taste  # tests whether Helmus remembers what the user said they like (a memory probe)
UNIT D fo_ask_recall_user_taste.0  # detector for 'what is my favorite' (tests whether Helmus remembers what the user said they like (a memory probe))
TAP fo_ask_recall_user_taste.0 1 1 w:is 1  # 'what is my favorite': needs w:is at 1..1
TAP fo_ask_recall_user_taste.0 2 2 w:my 1  # 'what is my favorite': needs w:my at 2..2
TAP fo_ask_recall_user_taste.0 3 3 w:favorite 1  # 'what is my favorite': needs w:favorite at 3..3
TAP fo_ask_recall_user_taste.0 0 0 w:what 1  # 'what is my favorite': needs w:what at 0..0
BIAS D fo_ask_recall_user_taste.0 -3  # AND of the 4 required parts of 'what is my favorite'
LINK U fo_ask_recall_user_taste D:fo_ask_recall_user_taste.0 1  # 'what is my favorite' is one way of saying: tests whether Helmus remembers what the user said they like (a memory probe)
UNIT D fo_ask_recall_user_taste.1  # detector for 'do you remember my favorite' (tests whether Helmus remembers what the user said they like (a memory probe))
