BIAS D fo_user_agrees.1 -1  # AND of the 2 required parts of '^ agreed|exactly|valid'
LINK U fo_user_agrees D:fo_user_agrees.1 1  # '^ agreed|exactly|valid' is one way of saying: the user agrees with what Helmus said ('facts', 'fair'): the reply is a short 'ikr' or moves on
