VOCAB rhymes  # a word a detector reads: known, so never read as a typo of another word
VOCAB rhyming  # a word a detector reads: known, so never read as a typo of another word
VOCAB rhymed  # a word a detector reads: known, so never read as a typo of another word
UNIT D bt_rhyme.0  # detector for 'rhyme|rhymes|rhyming|rhymed' (asks for a rhyme: a reply gives one easy rhyme or says orange has none)
TAP bt_rhyme.0 0 0 w:rhyme|w:rhymes|w:rhyming|w:rhymed 1  # 'rhyme|rhymes|rhyming|rhymed': needs w:rhyme|w:rhymes|w:rhyming|w:rhymed at 0..0
BIAS D bt_rhyme.0 0  # AND of the 1 required parts of 'rhyme|rhymes|rhyming|rhymed'
LINK U bt_rhyme D:bt_rhyme.0 1  # 'rhyme|rhymes|rhyming|rhymed' is one way of saying: asks for a rhyme: a reply gives one easy rhyme or says orange has none
